  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap rose 2.9% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $304.78B (2.9% higher over 30D) implies fresh dry powder entering crypto rails\u2014usually a constructive backdrop for settlement, trading, and on-chain cash demand. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-09-08-visa-stablecoin-settlement-tops-20-billion-annualized-run-rate-up-more-than-15x-year-over-year-413749\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visa stablecoin settlement tops $20 billion annualized run rate, up more than 15x year over year</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/08/visa-opens-settlement-data-to-help-blockchain-lenders-finance-crypto-cards-as-volume-surges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visa combines VisaNet data with onchain lending to power stablecoin card working capital</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/07/stablecoin-wallets-challenge-traditional-bank-accounts-as-main-consumer-money-hub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stablecoin wallets challenge traditional bank accounts as main consumer money hub</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
